# The Legend of Zelda: The Minish Cap (USA): title screen to Link's own house, Link in play with his hearts and rupee counter (gate G9, route depth).
# Start and A taps every 30 frames from frame 300 to 9,400 (the title, the file select, the intro, the Smith's cottage, the walk home), then no key.
# From about frame 9,400 Link stands next to the beds in his house and stays there, idle; the picture is the same from frame 9,500. For the delivered player with no save.
# frame,keyinput_active_low (the value holds until the next line)
